    "body": "> Yup, I’d love to.\r\n\r\nExcellent! Thank you for tackling this. 😄 \r\n\r\n> Would the option default to true?\r\n\r\nI wouldn't be opposed to it, but I'd be interested in hearing what others think (@starship/astronauts).\r\n\r\nI don't personally find the number to be actionable, so I'd leave it off, but I'd \r\nbe open to hearing others out.",
